This is the worst outcome in terms of experience received, particularly due to the length of the trial. If you want the most experience, then it's much better to do the leg work necessary for an innocent verdict. You will be letting an admitted adulterer and murderer go free though.

Death

|}

You can ask Jolee what he thinks of the verdict:

